{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9432": "OFFICER: 别再让我看见有人把告示贴得满城都是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9433": "JEROME: 这里怎么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9434": "MAN: 看见这些传单了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9435": "JEROME: 传单？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9436": "MAN: 不知道哪个疯子贴得满城都是！天还没亮，我店门上就有一张。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9437": "MAN: 我撕下来，不到一小时，又原封不动地钉了一张上去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9438": "CORDELIA: 上面写了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9439": "WOMAN: 居然是找猫！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9440": "WOMAN: 一看就是哪个无所事事的阔少，日子里没半点正经烦心事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9441": "WOMAN: 也不知是谁，趁我不留神往手袋里塞了一张，真不像话！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9442": "JEROME: 能让我看看吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9443": "ALEXANDRA: 那张纸有魔法，是土系魔法，我站这儿都能感觉到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9444": "CORDELIA: 我原本相当确定，除了你，人类已经无人能用土系魔法了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9445": "JEROME: 传单上说：“猫咪走失，寻回有赏。唤名胡须，会有回应。庄重中带着几分神气，凭此可辨。”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9446": "CORDELIA: 这描述没什么用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9447": "JEROME: 是一句诗，很有名的古诗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9448": "JEROME: 作者是杰赛亚·威格拉姆，笔名杰西库斯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9449": "JEROME: 母亲以前常读给我听。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9450": "CORDELIA: 那有什么关系？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9451": "JEROME: 这张传单的一切……纸张、墨水、字体，都和她读的那本书一模一样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9452": "JEROME: 这事没那么简单，有些古怪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9453": "JEROME: 传单让人去洛蕾恩的威格拉姆宅邸询问，就在东南方的海峡对面，坐飞空艇过去很快。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-c11flyers-9454": "CORDELIA: 非去不可的话……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9455": "JEROME: 这里是威格拉姆宅邸吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9456": "OFFICER: 那得看你问谁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9457": "OFFICER: 汤普森探长！又有人来了，一大群。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9458": "THOMPSON: 宴会客人还没来齐？有钱就是好，连守时都省了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9459": "THOMPSON: 你叫什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9460": "JEROME: 杰罗姆·雷诺医生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9461": "THOMPSON: 宾客名单上没有你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9462": "THOMPSON: 我在哪儿听过这个名字？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9463": "OFFICER: 他应该是……首都大战时参战的那位医生，对吧？上过报纸的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9464": "THOMPSON: 真是他？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9465": "THOMPSON: 说不定……我们正需要你这样的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9466": "THOMPSON: 能到二楼卧室来一趟吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9467": "JEROME: 我不……为什么要去？这里到底发生了什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9468": "THOMPSON: 医生，是这样……这里发生了谋杀案。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9469": "BUTLER: 您好，来威格拉姆宅邸有何贵干？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionEntry-9470": "BUTLER: 没有？恐怕眼下不便接待，改日再来吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionDoorOfficer-9471": "OFFICER: 这里由汤普森探长负责，最好照他说的做。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-mansionDoorOfficer-9472": "OFFICER: 我们这里正收尾。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Carneau-9473": "CARNEAU: 上楼去见汤普森探长吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Carneau-9474": "CARNEAU: 是雷诺医生吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Carneau-9475": "CARNEAU: 我们尽量把宾客分开了，免得他们互通消息，改口供。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Carneau-9476": "JEROME: 我还不知道这些人是谁，又为什么聚在这里，是有场宴会？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Carneau-9477": "CARNEAU: 对，是为那位年轻小姐，朱莉娅·鲍登办的，她和父亲鲁珀特·鲍登先生一起来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Carneau-9478": "CARNEAU: 不过，宴会的主人其实是朱莉娅的姨母，凯瑟琳·洛朗夫人。这是她家……或者说她家族的宅子，唉，我不懂有钱人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Carneau-9479": "CARNEAU: 其余大多是宾客，我可以把他们的情况告诉你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Carneau-9480": "CARNEAU: 查到新消息就回来告诉我，我记下来，你和汤普森探长随时可以查阅。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauStopperR-9481": "CARNEAU: 先上楼见汤普森探长吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauStopperL-9482": "CARNEAU: 先上楼见汤普森探长吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-leftThompsonFirst-9483": "OFFICER: 接触嫌疑人之前，请先与汤普森探长交谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-rightThompsonFirst-9484": "OFFICER: 接触嫌疑人之前，请先与汤普森探长交谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-f2Officer-9485": "OFFICER: 感谢协助，雷诺医生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-f2Officer-9486": "OFFICER: 汤普森探长在走廊右边，哈特小姐的房间里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-f2Officer-9487": "OFFICER: 卡尔诺警佐？在一楼，楼梯脚下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-f2Officer-9488": "OFFICER: 汤普森探长去找物证了，一会儿回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-f2Officer-9489": "OFFICER: 汤普森探长已经回哈特小姐房间了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9490": "THOMPSON: 谢谢你肯配合，医生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9491": "THOMPSON: 不介意的话，看看那边毯子下面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9492": "JEROME: 血迹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9493": "THOMPSON: 你是医生，能看出什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9494": "JEROME: 面积很大，病人，不，受害者失血很多。大部分血迹几乎同时干涸，说明失血很快。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9495": "THOMPSON: 还有呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9496": "JEROME: 没有挣扎或血液飞溅的痕迹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9497": "THOMPSON: 所以受害者遭到突然袭击？毫无还手之力？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9498": "JEROME: 我不是探长，也可能是急病。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9499": "THOMPSON: 可若是那样，总该知道她在哪儿，如今整栋屋子都找不到她的踪影。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9500": "JEROME: 她是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9501": "THOMPSON: 之前住在这里的一位年轻女子，叫艾米莉·哈特。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9502": "THOMPSON: 女仆说，今早进来时发现哈特小姐不见了，只剩这片血迹，这才叫来我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9503": "THOMPSON: 到现在，我从这些人嘴里撬出的，也就这么点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9504": "THOMPSON: 满屋子有钱蠢货，都是来参加什么豪华宴会的，一个个全哑巴了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9505": "THOMPSON: 以为耗到我走，就能跟这事撇清关系。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9506": "THOMPSON: 所以才需要你，雷诺医生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9507": "JEROME: 抱歉，我不太明白。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9508": "THOMPSON: 他们不知道哈特小姐被谋杀了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9509": "THOMPSON: 其实我也不知道，毕竟没有尸体，可女仆说漏了嘴，全屋子都知道血迹的事了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9510": "THOMPSON: 律师和有权势的朋友没来之前，宾客们不肯跟探长说话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9511": "THOMPSON: 可换成一位只想救哈特小姐的知名医生，他们也许就肯开口了——如果她还活着的话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9512": "JEROME: 宾客里有没有一位杰赛亚·威格拉姆？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9513": "THOMPSON: 威格拉姆家的人倒有几个，没见到叫杰赛亚的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9514": "THOMPSON: 下楼找我的警佐卡尔诺，他会把已知情况告诉你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-thompsonCase-9515": "THOMPSON: 我继续找物证。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9516": "CARNEAU: 目前的笔录都在这里，想了解谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9517": "凯瑟琳·洛朗",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9518": "CARNEAU: 凯瑟琳夫人是宅邸的主人，至少她常年住在这里，而且是朱莉娅的姨母，你最好先和她谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9519": "CARNEAU: 凯瑟琳夫人说，失踪女子因为神经衰弱发作，才来这里休养。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9520": "CARNEAU: 她说自己不清楚别的，让我们去她兄弟阿尔弗雷德·威格拉姆家找他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9521": "朱莉娅与鲁珀特·鲍登",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9522": "CARNEAU: 朱莉娅是主宾，今天本来是庆祝她初入社交界的宴会，也不知道那是什么讲究。鲁珀特是她父亲，不过这不是他们的宅子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9523": "CARNEAU: 朱莉娅说你“应该”去问她舅舅阿尔弗雷德，这个用词挺有意思。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9524": "CARNEAU: 她还提到，失踪女子脸上发红、浮肿，正在用魔法掩饰外貌。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9525": "安娜贝尔与法比安·凡尔纳",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9526": "CARNEAU: 安娜贝尔是凯瑟琳夫人的女儿，法比安是她丈夫，她在这栋宅子里长大。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9527": "CARNEAU: 安娜贝尔说，她的表亲内维尔和沃伦·威格拉姆，都与伊芙琳·哈考特有过情事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9528": "CARNEAU: 她不同意母亲的说法，不认为伊芙琳住进这里是阿尔弗雷德的主意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9529": "CARNEAU: 她还说，伊芙琳·哈考特用了幻形术，似乎在遮掩发胖或伤势。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9530": "CARNEAU: 此外，安娜贝尔认为，把客人藏在角落那间房很奇怪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9531": "斯托克斯",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9532": "CARNEAU: 斯托克斯是管家，比其他人还守口如瓶，管家嘛，你懂的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9533": "CARNEAU: 他说，失踪女子穿衣和洗澡都花很久，却不让任何人帮忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9534": "CARNEAU: 他还提到，凯瑟琳夫人让他打开角落那间房的衣柜，这小细节挺古怪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9535": "莉塞特",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9536": "CARNEAU: 莉塞特是女仆，发现血迹、报告哈特小姐失踪的就是她，不过雇主似乎对此不太高兴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9537": "CARNEAU: 她说听见有人去过失踪女子的房间，只知道是男人，不知道是谁。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9538": "CARNEAU: 那位女子似乎对气味格外敏感，还总往厕所跑。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9539": "CARNEAU: 莉塞特还说，斯托克斯先生让她打开伊芙琳房间的衣柜，这似乎很不寻常。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9540": "沃伦·威格拉姆",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9541": "CARNEAU: 沃伦是朱莉娅的表亲，一个有点花哨、不太聪明的公子哥，几天前到的，也是内维尔的哥哥。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9542": "CARNEAU: 他承认和失踪女子有过情事，但说早已结束。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9543": "CARNEAU: 他还否认自己可能是她腹中孩子的父亲，据他说，自己无法生育。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9544": "内维尔·威格拉姆",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9545": "CARNEAU: 内维尔是朱莉娅的另一位表亲，正在学做律师，昨天到的，也是沃伦的弟弟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9546": "CARNEAU: 他承认和失踪女子有过情事，但提供了昨晚的不在场证明。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9547": "CARNEAU: 乔治·斯洛普茅斯证实了这份不在场证明。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9548": "CARNEAU: 内维尔还提到哈考特小姐住的角落房间，说得神神秘秘的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9549": "CARNEAU: 这事最好问问仆人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9550": "麦克马斯特一家",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9551": "CARNEAU: 他们是这家人的朋友，几天前从海峡对面来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9552": "CARNEAU: 麦克马斯特一家已经明确认出，失踪女子是著名歌手伊芙琳·哈考特。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9553": "CARNEAU: 他们还说听见她房间里有人，却没听见开门声。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9554": "CARNEAU: 麦克马斯特夫人觉得，那天晚上失踪女子突然离开餐桌时，像是恶心想吐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9555": "乔治·斯洛普茅斯",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9556": "CARNEAU: 乔治·斯洛普茅斯也是这家的朋友，他们说他是来求婚的，好像是哪位名人的外孙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9557": "亨丽埃塔与阿尔芒·马洛里",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9558": "CARNEAU: 马洛里家是这家的朋友，亨丽埃塔是母亲，阿尔芒是儿子，看样子是来相亲的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9559": "CARNEAU: 马洛里母子没见过失踪女子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9560": "CARNEAU: 不过，马洛里夫人说，她在首都看演出时，曾见那位女子一反常态地气喘起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9561": "阿尔弗雷德·威格拉姆",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9562": "CARNEAU: 阿尔弗雷德是凯瑟琳的兄弟，我们到时他不在宅邸里，可凯瑟琳夫人总是在提他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9563": "CARNEAU: 看来他是医生，负责照料失踪女子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9564": "暂时不用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-carneauList-9565": "CARNEAU: 从证人那里问到新消息，就回来找我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9566": "关于哈特小姐，你知道些什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9567": "CATHERINE: 说实话，我不太了解她，是我兄弟阿尔弗雷德请我给她安排个房间的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9568": "CATHERINE: 她过度劳累，需要个地方恢复体力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9569": "过度劳累？还有其他症状吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9570": "CATHERINE: 说了，我很少见她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9571": "CATHERINE: 负责照料她的是我兄弟，他和你一样是医生，住在林间小路不远处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9572": "CATHERINE: 如果你能说服警察让我离开这个房间，我可以带路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9573": "CATHERINE: 没人指路，你肯定会迷路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9574": "JEROME: 警方暂时不准任何人离开宅邸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9575": "这是你的宅子？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9576": "CATHERINE: 是，嗯，法律上这宅子属于我父亲，杰赛亚·威格拉姆。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9577": "杰赛亚也在吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9578": "CATHERINE: 不，父亲年纪很大了，而且……一直有病，不会出席。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9579": "昨晚谁去过伊芙琳的房间？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9580": "CATHERINE: 最好谁也没去，我可不想这里闹出丑闻，你听说什么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9581": "CATHERINE: 真有人去，也许是我兄弟，他一直在为她诊治。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9582": "CATHERINE: 真的不能让我带你去找他吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9583": "你知道哈特小姐就是伊芙琳·哈考特吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9584": "CATHERINE: 对我来说没什么区别，我只是看在兄弟的份上让她住下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9585": "CATHERINE: 你真的得让我带你去见他，这一切都离不开他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9586": "昨晚谁去过伊芙琳的房间？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9587": "CATHERINE: 最好谁也没去，我可不想这里闹出丑闻，你听说什么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9588": "CATHERINE: 真有人去，也许是我兄弟，他一直在为她诊治。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9589": "CATHERINE: 真的不能让我带你去找他吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9590": "听说你的侄子们都和伊芙琳有过情事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9591": "CATHERINE: 据我所知，哈考特小姐的交际……相当广，与她有往来的可不止我那几个侄子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9592": "听说是你邀请哈考特小姐来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9593": "CATHERINE: 我是应兄弟的请求邀请她的，不信就去他家问。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9594": "CATHERINE: 不远。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Catherine-9595": "没什么了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-catherineIntro-9596": "CATHERINE: 哦，谢天谢地，你是律师？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-catherineIntro-9597": "JEROME: 不，我是杰罗姆·雷诺医生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-catherineIntro-9598": "JEROME: 听说有位客人受伤，我想帮她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-catherineIntro-9599": "CATHERINE: 啊，好，总算有人不急着下结论了，真希望这事赶紧解决。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9600": "JULIA: 哦，那个……你好？我们好像没见过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9601": "JEROME: 你好，我是雷诺医生，你一定是朱莉娅。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9602": "JULIA: 是的，幸会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9603": "你见过哈特小姐吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9604": "JULIA: 只在晚餐时见过一次，我才来了几天。哈特小姐以前……我是说，她这个人有点……嗯……那个词怎么说……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9605": "JULIA: 深居简出，对，就是这个词。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9606": "JULIA: 这些事你应该去问我舅舅阿尔弗雷德，他是医生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9607": "JULIA: 我只想让自己初入社交界的舞会继续办下去，毕竟有些客人是大老远赶来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9608": "你知道她是伊芙琳·哈考特吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9609": "JULIA: 真是她？可伊芙琳不是出了名的美人吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9610": "JULIA: 哈特小姐脸又肿又红，衣服也土气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9611": "JULIA: 我还听说，她用魔法美化外貌，没准全是骗人的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9612": "RUPERT: 朱莉娅……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9613": "JULIA: 怎么了？我要会，我也用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9614": "昨晚你们去过伊芙琳的房间吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9615": "RUPERT: 没有。我们住在外面的别舍，不在主宅。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9616": "RUPERT: 我们最不想卷进什么纠葛。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Julia-9617": "没有别的问题，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Rupert-9618": "RUPERT: 我们在首都的家被夷平后，多亏凯瑟琳好心，答应让我们在这里举办舞会。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/jeromeSidequest.yarn-Rupert-9619": "RUPERT: 舞会竟被这种事打断了，真遗憾，你说警方今晚之前总能处理完吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3504": "Title: 急需援手",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3505": "Description: 前往科黛莉娅世界的莱奥尼亚，看看谁需要帮助。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3506": "Title: 怪事一桩",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3507": "Description: 前往东南方海峡对岸，拜访洛蕾恩的威格拉姆宅邸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3508": "Title: 命案发生",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3509": "Description: 上二楼与汤普森先生交谈。"
}
